 "paragraphs": [
  "Aliya, Zade and the young falcon found the wolf who asked them, “Do you have the secret password?”",
  "They said in unison, “399.”",
  "“Yes, that’s right. Come with me.”",
  "Aliya, Zade and the young falcon made it to the party where they saw all the animals from the mangroves waiting for them."
